            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write left, middle and right downstrokes, joined at the bottom."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左・中央・右の下向きの線を続け、下部でつなぎます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最后在右下向右收笔。": {
